  "label": {
    "en": [
      "An early 20th‑century printed postcard with blue text in Estonian on a beige background. On the right side there is a simple line drawing of an elderly, long‑bearded figure in flowing robes placing or taking papers from a bag and carrying a lyre on his back. The left side is filled with decorative script text referencing \"Wanemuise\" and dated Tartu, 18 December 1905."
